# --- Secrets / credentials (never commit) ---
.env
.env.*
.dev.vars
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*credentials*.json
*token*
*secret*
# 上面 *token* 这条本来是为了挡密钥/token 文件，但会连带把 Next.js 动态路由目录
# app/id/[token]/ 也误判成要忽略的敏感文件（第十六轮登录换血新增的身份直连路由），
# 显式加白名单，不然这个真实源码文件会被静默排除在版本控制之外。
!app/id/
!app/id/\[token\]/
!app/id/\[token\]/route.ts
*.crt

# --- Cloudflare / OpenNext ---
.open-next/
.wrangler/
worker-configuration.d.ts

# --- Node / npm ---
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
.pnpm-store/

# --- Next.js ---
.next/
out/
.vercel
next-env.d.ts

# --- TypeScript ---
*.tsbuildinfo

# --- SQLite / app data (self-hosted runtime data, never commit) ---
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db
/data/
uploads/
receipts/

# --- Drizzle (generated migration meta, keep migrations/*.sql, ignore local journal if needed) ---
# 注: drizzle 生成的 migrations/*.sql 应该提交进版本控制，这里不忽略 migrations 目录本身

# --- Testing / coverage ---
coverage/
.vitest-cache/

# --- Build / misc ---
dist/
build/

# --- OS / editor ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# --- Docker local overrides ---
docker-compose.override.yml

# --- D1 数据库人工导出备份 (含真实邮箱/密码哈希/身份链接token,严禁提交) ---
backups/
